⚙️ How to Deploy This Utility

1. Set Local Environment TokensInject your infrastructure credentials 
dynamically into the session runtime to keep passwords out of your codebase:
bash
export SF_USER="your_snowflake_username"
export SF_PASSWORD="your_secure_password"
export SF_ACCOUNT="your_account_id.region"
export SF_WAREHOUSE="your_management_warehouse"
export SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL="https://slack.com"

2. Test ExecutionRun the script manually to confirm data extraction formatting and verification workflows work as intended:
bash
python3 finops_audit_alerter.py

3. Schedule Production Monitoring (Cron)To run this audit automatically every morning at 07:00 AM, append the execution route 
to your machine's system task scheduler:
text
0 7 * * * /usr/bin/python3 /absolute/path/to/finops_audit_alerter.py >> /var/log/finops_audit.log 2>&1
